<title>USA: Livestock/meat crossings at U.S./Canadian border.</title>
<headline>Livestock/meat crossings at U.S./Canadian border.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Canada reported the following preliminary livestock and meat crossings at the U.S./Canadian border. - USDA</p>
<p>Canadian Imports from the U.S.:		    yr to   yr ago</p>
<p>			06/14/97 06/07/97 06/15/96   date    to date</p>
<p>Livestock/in head</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:    106	 22    165 :   1,663     4,574</p>
<p>Heifers:		   2	201     36 :     683	 712</p>
<p>Cows:		    467	259     85 :  15,228    10,756</p>
<p>Bulls:		    51	  2	2 :     913	 906</p>
<p>Totals		   626	484    288 :  18,487    16,948</p>
<p>Canadian Imports from the U.S. - Meat (1,000 lbs):</p>
<p>     PERIOD    PREVIOUS    LAST     1997	SAME     YTD</p>
<p>     ENDING    WEEK	  YEAR    YEAR TO   PERIOD   PERCENT</p>
<p>     06/14/97  06/07/97  06/15/96   Date*    Last yr.  Change</p>
<p>Beef  4,180     3,807     4,705 :  92,258   108,241  -  14.8%</p>
<p>Pork  3,049     2,394     1,296 :  44,063    37,125  +  18.7%</p>
<p>Canadian Exports into the U.S. - Meat (1,000 lbs):</p>
<p>	PERIOD    PREVIOUS    LAST    1997	SAME	YTD</p>
<p>	ENDING    WEEK	  YEAR    TO	 PERIOD   PERCENT</p>
<p>Meat  06/14/97  06/07/97  06/15/96  Date*    Last yr.  Change</p>
<p>Beef   15,836    11,949     9,334  258,749   180,810 + 43.1%</p>
<p>Pork    6,881     8,441     1,578  154,395   131,240 + 17.6%</p>
<p>*Year to date totals may reflect revisions from previous weeks</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
